{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20187","headline":"列仙文 金母飞空歌 · 孟郊","name":"列仙文 金母飞空歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驾我八景舆，歘然入玉清。\n龙羣拂霄上，虎旗摄朱兵。\n逍遥三弦际，万流无暂停。\n哀此去留会，劫尽天地倾。\n当寻无中景，不死亦不生。\n体彼自然道，寂观合大冥。\n南岳挺直干，玉英曜頴精。\n有任靡期事，无心自虚灵。\n嘉会绦河内，相与乐未英。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}